---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Base title="Thank You | Jack P. Flaherty"
  description="Thank you. Jack has your details. He reads every inquiry himself and replies within one business day."
  path="/thank-you-jack-flaherty" noindex={true}>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Thank you. Jack has your details.</h1>
      <div class="grid c2" style="margin:1.5rem 0 2.5rem">
        <div class="card"><ul class="checks">
          <li>Risk decisions moving forward without documented governance.</li>
          <li>Digital transformation stalled because the leadership team won't commit.</li>
          <li>AI being deployed in your organization with no board-level oversight.</li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="card"><ul class="checks">
          <li>Consciously filter noise and discover critical insights.</li>
          <li>Lead with clarity &amp; objectivity, not gut instinct alone.</li>
          <li>Build resilient teams who thrive in a changing world.</li>
        </ul></div>
      </div>
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="lede">Jack reads every inquiry himself and replies within one business day, with questions rather than a brochure.</p>
        <ol>
          <li>You will hear from Jack within one business day.</li>
          <li>If the date and the room fit, the next step is a 30-minute discovery call about who is in the room and what decision they are facing.</li>
          <li>No proposal goes out before that call.</li>
        </ol>
        <p>Want to skip ahead? Pick a time now.</p>
        <div class="btns"><a class="btn" href={site.calendly}>Book a discovery call</a><a class="btn alt" href="/insights">Read the Insights meanwhile</a></div>
        <p class="meta" style="margin-top:1.8rem;font-size:1rem">Something urgent? Email <a href={'mailto:' + site.email}>{site.email}</a> directly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .card ul.checks { margin: 0; }
  .card ul.checks li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
</style>
